        "m_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A simmer, not a boil",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our black tiger shrimp arrive easy-peel and already deveined, so prep is just peeling, pulling off the tails and patting them dry. Thaw the bag in the fridge overnight. Keep the broth at a gentle simmer once the shrimp go in: they are done in 2&ndash;3 minutes, when they curl into a C and turn pink and opaque. Move them straight into ice water for 2 minutes so they stop cooking and stay tender.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "m_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Shop Black Tiger Shrimp",
            "button_link": "/products/black-tiger-shrimp-mangrove-regeneration",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_size": "md",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "m_sub",
        "m_head",
