        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each bag holds 16 oz of head-off, easy-peel black tiger shrimp, already deveined. They are raised extensively within protected mangrove forest at Tarakan, Indonesia.</p><p>Our Mangrove Black Tiger Shrimp tested at about 40 mg of marine omega-3s (EPA + DHA) and 18 mcg selenium, per 4 oz portion of raw, easy-peel shrimp. Values vary by sample and season.</p><p>Low mercury, tested to a tenth of the FDA action level. Every supplier is third-party tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard. Farms named, panels published.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
